Package: Worthwhile
Title: Worthwhile Personal Time and Work Decision Support
Version: 0.6.0
Description: Private cloud and local workload planning with resumable tasks, independent work sessions, dated replanning previews, trade-off scenarios, explainable priorities, modular work roles, goals, and historical reflection. Run app.R with shiny::runApp.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
